# Legacy root routes → canonical localized routes (301).
# S+ Task 12A / issue #98: the pre-bilingual root URLs must not serve
# duplicate content; they redirect to the canonical EN structure.
# (Workers Static Assets honors this file; builds also emit meta-refresh
# stubs as a fallback for hosts that do not read _redirects.)
/about/ /en/about/ 301
/contact/ /en/contact/ 301
/privacy/ /en/privacy/ 301
/security/ /en/security/ 301
/support/ /en/support/ 301
/products/ /en/products/ 301
/products/* /en/products/ 301
/ /en/ 301
